WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Nie Zi, I’m annoying you.

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:11,840
Who are you who dare to urinate into the wine gourd used to offer wine? I am your father.

3
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,000
Bah, I'm still your father

4
00:00:13,360 --> 00:00:15,480
Nie Zi Pirates of the Sail Tiangang

5
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:17,880
See if I don’t beat you to death today

6
00:00:24,920 --> 00:00:26,880
Think of me as a good young man of the 21st century

7
00:00:27,120 --> 00:00:28,400
As soon as I crossed over, I was chased and beaten.

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:29,560
What is this?

9
00:00:30,590 --> 00:00:31,750
Nie Zi, come down here

10
00:00:31,750 --> 00:00:33,790
Come on, come up if you can

11
00:00:34,950 --> 00:00:36,070
You thought you were on a tree

12
00:00:36,070 --> 00:00:37,990
I have no choice but to bring a knife

13
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:49,700
Fang Jingsheng

14
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:52,180
I am his only prodigal son Fang Yao

15
00:00:52,620 --> 00:00:54,300
This dad’s strength is a bit high.

16
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:56,260
Those who are real are heroes

17
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:00,780
Dad, I realized my mistake and said

18
00:01:01,220 --> 00:01:03,100
Why did you pee in the teacher's gourd?

19
00:01:03,100 --> 00:01:06,030
The child doesn’t want to study Nie Zi

20
00:01:06,310 --> 00:01:07,630
To send you to Imperial College

21
00:01:07,870 --> 00:01:09,910
I spent five thousand taels of silver on my father

22
00:01:10,030 --> 00:01:11,830
Dad, it’s already like this

23
00:01:11,830 --> 00:01:13,230
That’s already the case, right?

24
00:01:13,930 --> 00:01:14,930
Unfilial child

25
00:01:15,090 --> 00:01:16,770
I can’t serve you anymore

26
00:01:16,970 --> 00:01:20,570
You have to take good care of yourself and wait patiently

27
00:01:21,130 --> 00:01:22,690
Dad doesn’t want to forgive me

28
00:01:22,930 --> 00:01:25,770
That kid can only die to apologize.

29
00:01:25,770 --> 00:01:28,530
Son, daddy didn’t blame you for putting down the knife

30
00:01:28,530 --> 00:01:30,330
Dad, you really forgive me

31
00:01:30,690 --> 00:01:33,660
It’s because dad didn’t make good friends. You read that correctly.

32
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:35,860
It is impossible for Lao Deng to really let his own son die.

33
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:37,340
Otherwise, I would have been smashed as soon as I traveled through time.

34
00:01:37,340 --> 00:01:38,580
Too unlucky

35
00:01:41,620 --> 00:01:43,500
The people who established the country now have no power and nothing to do

36
00:01:43,820 --> 00:01:45,180
Dad took over the job of searching for a borderland

37
00:01:45,700 --> 00:01:48,140
Once gone, it can take as little as two to three months or as many as half a year.

38
00:01:48,380 --> 00:01:49,420
Be honest at home

39
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:53,820
Don't cause any more trouble

40
00:01:54,100 --> 00:01:55,740
You have to spend money at home, dad

41
00:01:56,140 --> 00:01:57,100
Give me a few thousand taels

42
00:01:57,260 --> 00:02:04,100
I will wait for you to come back honestly. How about Uncle Fang?

43
00:02:06,960 --> 00:02:10,000
Yiran, come to see Yang Er, Uncle Fang?

44
00:02:10,660 --> 00:02:12,900
Yi Ran is here to break off the engagement.

45
00:02:16,490 --> 00:02:18,090
We have achieved success as a nation

46
00:02:18,330 --> 00:02:20,010
Do you really agree with nature

47
00:02:20,330 --> 00:02:21,810
From now on, you and I have nothing to do with each other

48
00:02:29,370 --> 00:02:30,770
This fabric is very particular

49
00:02:31,170 --> 00:02:32,250
The matter of breaking off the engagement

50
00:02:32,490 --> 00:02:33,930
Does your father, Mr. Song, know?

51
00:02:33,930 --> 00:02:35,330
Exactly what my father meant

52
00:02:37,020 --> 00:02:38,660
Got it, you can go

53
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:40,710
Now that the marriage has been called off

54
00:02:40,830 --> 00:02:42,150
Loss of charge after three days

55
00:02:42,660 --> 00:02:44,500
Mr. Fang doesn’t need to accompany me.

56
00:02:44,700 --> 00:02:46,100
Walk slowly, no delivery

57
00:02:48,040 --> 00:02:49,360
It’s good to break off the engagement

58
00:02:49,720 --> 00:02:51,720
Women will only affect the speed at which I make money
